{"id":"wb-7-1011","name":"寺平村乡土建筑","retrievedAt":"2026-11-06T11:54:03+00:00","status":"ready","title":"寺平村","text":"寺平村位于浙江省金华市婺城区汤溪镇。早在元末明初，寺平村的先祖就迁居于此繁衍生息，距今已有七百余年的历史。村内保留有丰富完整的民居格局和多处完整的厅堂建筑，具有十分浓厚的徽派建筑风格特点，被誉为“中国最漂亮砖雕民居村”。2010年，寺平村被列入第五批中国历史文化名村，2013年5月，寺平村乡土建筑被列入第七批全国重点文物保护单位。","shortened":false,"sourceUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E5%AF%BA%E5%B9%B3%E6%9D%91","revisionId":90404945,"revisionUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?oldid=90404945","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/","authors":"维基百科贡献者","matchEvidence":"名称与所在地一致","image":{"path":"assets/wikipedia/866fa006008219a44f402fda.jpg","title":"Jinhua_Siping_2016.12.04_16-52-12.jpg","sourceUrl":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Jinhua_Siping_2016.12.04_16-52-12.jpg","originalUrl":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/d/d2/Jinhua_Siping_2016.12.04_16-52-12.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=original","author":"Zhangzhugang","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0","caption":"百顺堂","width":320,"height":213}}